WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.020
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.850
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.740
Shu-

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.450
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.340
Start-

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.110
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.000
Today-

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.470
Today, Amu and her fated rival finally come head-to-head!

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.390
How-

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.050
How do you think it'll end?

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.980
St-

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:17.160
Stay tuned!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.550
Doki!

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.020
I wanted to say something, too!

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.100
Let's go!

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:43.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:55.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:55.620 --> 00:01:00.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:07.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:12.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:18.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:38.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.050
It sure is noisy today.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.450
The academy newspaper's...

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.990
Seiyo Academy Girls' Popularity Ranking?!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.720
1: Hinamori Amu 2: Mashiro Rima 3: Yuiki Yaya 4: Fujisaki Nadeshiko

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.070
Knew it. Hinamori Amu's at the top!

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.720
All the Guardians are awesome, though.

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:12.060
Are they seriously not bored of this yet?

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.060
What a joke.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.660
So cool!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.140
A typical Joker response!

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.270
So "cool & spicy!"

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.720
Yet again you have...

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.230
Wanna hang out somewhere on the way home?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:29.820
Sure.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:32.310
Magnificent, Hinamori-san.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:36.500
Once again, you're ranked the 
most popular girl in school.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.100
I'd expect nothing less from my rival.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:43.340
But do you really expect to claim 
victory from something like that?

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:44.810
We're not actually competing, you know...

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.490
Amu, we have to hurry to the Royal Garden.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:49.510
Right.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.850
So... um... see you later!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.350
There will be no "later."

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:58.570
I will be transferring to another school.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:10.960
Episode 68
Fare Thee Well, Yamabuki Saya

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.970
What the heck?

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:14.520
Are you really going, Amu?

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.830
Sure. She did invite us.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.650
I want to repay the favor.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.050
That's true.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:24.930
I can't believe Yamabuki-san's transferring, though.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.560
Some of you may already be aware of this,

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.950
but due to Yamabuki-san's father's company, 
the Yamabuki Concern, moving overseas

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.560
she'll be going to live in Los Angeles.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.800
Would you like to say anything to your classmates?

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.550
Yes.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.720
Fare Thee Well Yamabuki Saya-sama Grand Farewell Party?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.630
We hope you'll all join us!

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.780
It will be your last opportunity to 
spend time with me, after all!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.370
It's pretty weird to throw your own farewell party...

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.710
No kidding.

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.970
We're still... at school, aren't we?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.220
I've been waiting for you, Hinamori-san.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.810
Thank you all for coming!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:22.930
We will now begin the Fare Thee Well 
Yamabuki Saya-sama Grand Farewell Party!

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:30.270
Do not lament my departure!

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:34.160
And now, a flamenco dance performance!

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.450
That's the limbo!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:40.570
She has quite a good sense of humor.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.920
And now, it is time for a poem.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.170
This piece was composed by yours truly,

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.270
and is entitled:

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.870
"Thank Heavens I was Born a Celebrity."

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.770
This isn't a farewell party!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.330
It's just Yamabuki-san showing off!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.370
Yeah, totally!

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:02.640
Amu-chan, say something!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.030
Um...

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.540
Since this is a farewell 
party, maybe you should-

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.010
Hinamori-san!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:07.850
What?!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:14.470
Do you envy the fact that they are all 
captivated by me instead of you now?

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:20.680
My deepest apologies, but 
<i>I</i> am the star of this show.

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:22.290
Lame.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.080
Let's go.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.640
Hold it!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:30.560
Hinamori-san, I've prepared a 
special event just for you.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.850
I call it:

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:37.790
Yamabuki Saya vs. Hinamori Amu
Three-Part Celebrity Duel!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:41.330
Which one of us is the most excellent celebrity?

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.620
Before I transfer...

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.950
We're going to settle this <i>once and for all!</i>

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.510
Um, that's kind of...

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:49.650
A celebrity competition?

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.130
That sounds awesome!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.160
Hinamori-senpai's going to 
be in a duel, you say?

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.020
That's my cue, isn't it?

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.150
It's you...

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.470
How long our time apart 
has been, Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.520
Do you remember me? 
I'm Suzuki Seichiro!

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.000
If you intend to go into battle,

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.060
I shall cheer you on, even 
if you do not ask for it!

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:12.250
Now, we duel!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:17.400
Go! Fight! Hi-na-mo-ri!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.460
There's no backing out now...

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.270
Why is this happening to me?!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.690
Round 1:

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.480
Beautiful Walking Competition!

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.820
What is the point of this?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.560
A graceful walk is fundamental for a celebrity.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.390
Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:36.600
Amu-chan!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.740
Go!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.930
There's nothing beautiful about this.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.820
Amu-chi!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.270
We came to root for you!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.720
Guys...

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.770
Tadase-sama!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:50.450
You've come to cheer me on, haven't you?!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:51.890
U-Um...

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.470
Goal!

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:56.080
Hinamori-senpai wins!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.610
Good for me...

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.170
Round 2:

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:03.510
Exotic Flower Arrangement Competition!

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:08.090
A good aesthetic sense is something 
every celebrity must have.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.110
What should I do with this?

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.210
You've just gotta go with the flow.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.630
How do you like this?

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.140
That's our Saya-sama!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.320
Look at that. She's quite talented.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.850
How did Amu-chi do?

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.240
A Christmas tree?

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.850
It is revolutionary!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:34.990
Never have I seen such an avant garde work!

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:36.910
I have been utterly defeated!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.010
Really?

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.440
Yippee!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.020
If you win two of the three rounds...

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.130
Then you're the champion!

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.300
Congratulations!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.440
I don't feel much like a winner...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.530
Hinamori-san! It's a tad soon for celebrations!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.810
The final duel remains!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.700
But Amu-chi's already got this in the bag.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.980
Oh, did I forget to tell you?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.900
The final duel is worth... three points!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:03.810
Cheater.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.050
The Three-Part Celebrity Duel's Final Round:

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.020
Dodgeball Competition!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.330
So much for the "celebrity" part...

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:15.030
The dodgeball competition is about to begin!

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.500
The play-by-plays will be handled by me!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.060
This is all brought to you 
by me, Suzuki Seichiro!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.250
Nikaidou-sensei will be the referee.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.770
Glad to help.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.690
As part of today's special rules, there will be 
no substitutions or people on the sidelines.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:33.180
It's a sudden-death battle 
to the last man standing!

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:35.440
Sorry for getting you guys involved in this.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.520
No worries! Let's do this!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:40.530
Let the game begin!

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.390
Now, we duel!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.650
I'm actually... pretty good at dodgeball!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.990
Special Technique: One-Handed Catch!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.490
With neither team admitting defeat thus far,

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:00.390
this match is reaching its white-hot climax!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.430
I'm tired. This sucks.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.430
Mashiro-san, keep at it!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.930
You can do it, guys!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:08.100
I will not lose!

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.060
Yaya, nice!

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.060
What gives you the right 
to dodge, Hinamori-san?!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.640
Yaya, don't go!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.910
Saya-sama, it's time for you know what.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.100
Be my guest.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.770
What are they doing?

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:32.430
Special Attack: Miracle Clone Ball!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.860
No fair! That's against the rules!

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.070
Sensei!

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.120
Here is your tea.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.390
Thank you.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:43.090
It's a fierce battle between offense and defense!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:46.360
Both teams' members are falling like flies!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:52.250
With only the leaders remaining, we've 
got ourselves a full-scale showdown!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:54.810
Where's Rima?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.470
I'm tired. You handle the rest.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.930
Hinamori-san.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.260
At last, the time has come.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:07.420
For this day, I hang my hopes...

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.440
My hopes...

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:14.520
On this final ball!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.230
Amu-chan, Character Change!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.060
Hinamori-san is outside the court...

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:37.430
Which makes me the victor!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.490
Are you okay?

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.130
Yes!

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.430
Incredible!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:50.840
Let's give a round of applause for 
competitor Hinamori-senpai!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.710
You should've won, Saya-sama...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.020
Are you okay?

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.020
I am za winnah...

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:20.210
I did it! I beat Hinamori Amu!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.430
Saya-sama...

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.500
It's like your heart's not in it.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:27.410
You did beat her at dodgeball today.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:31.800
I cannot take pride in such a paltry victory!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.890
Just you wait, Hinamori Amu!

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:40.440
Yesterday sure was tough, wasn't it?

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:47.100
Yeah, but I think we should throw a 
real farewell party for Yamabuki-san.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.980
Hinamori-san!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.770
Let's duel!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.750
But you finished the duel yes-

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.270
It's far from over!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.770
Anyway... Yamabuki-san, would you 
come to the Royal Garden later?

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.100
The Royal Garden?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:06.240
Yeah! Let's have a farewell party for 
you with the other Guardians!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.740
Thank you for the invitation, 
but I'm afraid I must decline.

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:17.060
After all, if a true celebrity such as I were to 
intrude upon you I would just cause a disruption.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.570
Would that not vex Tadase-sama?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:22.810
You think? I figured he'd 
be happy to have you...

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.100
Well... if you <i>insist</i>...

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.470
I suppose I've no choice!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.410
Uh-huh, she wanted to come all along.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.100
She's such a pain.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.610
Yamabuki-san's taking a long time.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.250
Hello, everyone!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.050
Thank you all for waiting!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.750
Perfume!

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:46.970
She's a little too excited about this.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:52.290
I could not afford to offend Tadase-sama 
after he so graciously invited me here.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.780
Huh? I did what?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.200
But I'm the one who...

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.430
Tadase-sama!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.780
Amu-chi, are you okay with this?

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.560
W-Well...

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:08.640
I have to say, Yamabuki-san, that dodgeball 
match yesterday was amazing.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.460
Oh dear! How mortifying to know 
you've seen me act so unladylike!

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.120
Don't say that.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.780
I like girls who have spunk.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.360
Did he just...

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.650
I like... like...

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.810
Confess his love?!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.680
Y-Yamabuki-san?

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.580
That's true. And our Amu-chi's always been spunky.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.940
Now hold on...

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.720
That's not your only good quality, Hinamori-san.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.330
What have we here?

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.800
You're both blushing!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.140
Enough already, Yaya!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.640
Not again!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.640
Stop it! Cut it out!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.840
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:57.580
Yamabuki-san?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.270
What's wrong with her?

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.220
Banana-flavored bean jelly?

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.300
You developin' a taste for the local grub?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.810
They said this was all they had.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:12.190
Well, I'm havin' me some uirou, as always!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.600
What is it?

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.340
I can feel someone frettin'!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.020
Pedigree, assets, looks, talent...

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:30.760
I should be superior in them all!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.140
So why can't I beat Hinamori-san?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.140
I might as well...

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.560
Perhaps if I acted like her...

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.400
Maybe I will...

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.980
You're lost, aren't-

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.440
Just a moment!

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:50.330
I do not know who you are, but I ask that you 
not address me in such a familiar manner.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.620
Are you sure about this one?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:58.260
It's got to be her! There 
ain't no one else around.

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.420
If you feel lost for some 
reason, you can tell-

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:03.100
That is none of your concern.

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:05.100
Hey! Where do you get off...

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.220
Simmer down now, Lulu.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.000
Fine, whatever. Look here.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.270
What a garish piece of jewelry. It's... so...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:23.340
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:34.690
I wonder where Yamabuki-san went...

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.790
I'm concerned about her.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.820
Ah, Amu-chan!

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.140
Yamabuki-san!

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:43.690
We were worried. Please 
come back to the Royal Garden.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:48.310
It's come to my attention 
that I've been mistaken.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.670
It's a ? Egg!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:55.390
Allow me to reveal my true self!

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.990
Yamabuki-san is ? Character Transforming?

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:05.430
What's going to happen?

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:12.520
Character Transformation: Hinamori Dream!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.770
Hinamori... Dream?

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.870
<i>Two</i> Hinamori Amus?

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.770
What kind of plot twist is this?

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:24.120
Now the playing field's even! 
Let's get this over with!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.500
Ran, Character Transform!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.640
Okay!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.780
My heart:

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.030
Unlock!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.620
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.570
In that case, I'll transform as well.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.950
My heart:

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.350
Unlock!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.720
Character Transformation: Gorgeous Heart!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.670
I can transform, too!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:21.720
You've got to be kidding me.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.990
That's some power she's got there...

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:25.770
This might actually work.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.290
Hinamori-san! Now, we duel!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.870
Amu-chan, let's fly!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:32.470
Right!

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.390
Heart Speeders!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:44.450
I appear to be faster than you!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.930
Heart Rod!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:52.060
Spiral Heart Special!

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:53.700
Gorgeous Rod!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.930
Gorgeous Heart Special!

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.210
Ran, switch with me!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.130
Okay!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.790
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.170
I won't let you win!

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:20.000
Character Transformation: Gorgeous Spade!

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.140
Spade, too?

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:24.020
Amu-chan, stay calm!

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:24.810
Let's go!

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:35.300
Prism Music!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.470
Break Music!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.140
What a cacophony!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.400
This is just awful!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.020
Su, Character Transform!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.490
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.550
Remake Honey!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.140
Now, none of that.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.900
Character Transformation: Gorgeous Clover!

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:17.140
Break Honey!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.730
I am invincible!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:27.980
Yamabuki-san!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.700
Come to your senses!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:36.170
You're one to talk. Why don't you 
wake up and admit your defeat?

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.100
I'm the best!

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.490
But you're just copying Amu-chan!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.540
Are you really happy about winning this way?

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:50.820
That's right! You don't have to act like me! 
There's plenty of great things about you!

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:53.060
Like... what?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:59.940
You know, like how you're stubborn, 
selfish, egotistical, and vain...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.560
Are those supposed to be compliments?

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.420
But that's part of what makes you great.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:05.710
You always look ahead without losing heart.

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:08.770
You have some really wonderful qualities!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.620
I do?

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.210
I have wonderful...

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.710
But I...

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.520
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.210
Open Heart!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.490
The Embryo was a no-show...

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:54.520
Didn't live up to expectations, did she?

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.160
Let's go, Nana.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:58.610
Time for more banana-flavored bean jelly.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.370
Ain't nothin' for it...

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.740
Why am I... What has happened to me?

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.970
Saya-sama!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.890
Are you okay, Yamabuki-san?

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.600
Hinamori-san! Let us du...

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:21.970
What is this? I feel unexpectedly refreshed...

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.560
Even once you've gone overseas, keep 
being exactly who you are, Yamabuki-san.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.140
Hinamori-san...

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.090
How do you think Yamabuki-san is doing?

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:40.760
With that personality of hers, I think 
she'll be fine wherever she goes.

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:41.750
Got that right.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:43.090
Hinamori-san!

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:45.730
Let us duel!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:48.520
Yamabuki-san, didn't you transfer?

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:53.670
I asked my father for permission 
to remain in Japan on my own.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:55.460
Just for you.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:56.430
For me?!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:01.860
I must remain here, for 
I am your eternal rival!

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:04.810
This day marks the beginning 
of our true battle!

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:07.040
I'm pretty sure I said...

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:09.020
Good luck with that, Amu.

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:12.130
Now, Hinamori-san, let us duel!

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:19.520
Give me a break...

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:23.300
(For real?)

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:26.070
(Eh?)

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.280
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:30.930
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:31.540 --> 00:22:36.510
If we ended up becoming adults today,

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:41.050
I bet we'd lose sight of everything except what's in front of us.

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:42.430
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:47.350
So I wonder what we've been

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:51.850
so engrossed with finding all this time.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:53.300
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:55.060
Someone once said:

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:57.760
"We were born to be happy,

00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:03.980
so let's live to make others happy!"

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:06.640
How long will I have to

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:08.390
carry all this love in my heart?

00:23:08.390 --> 00:23:09.340
How long will I have to

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:11.040
carry all this love in my heart?

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:16.460
I wonder when I'll be able to let it all out.

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:17.560
How many of

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.210
all those days in my heart...

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.240
How many of

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:21.900
all those days in my heart...

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:27.430
How many of them have we run through?

00:23:27.430 --> 00:23:28.430
With this much love

00:23:28.430 --> 00:23:30.170
filling my heart...

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:31.190
With this much love

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:32.850
filling my heart...

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.500
I hugged you tightly,

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:41.040
and during that time, we both felt so much happiness.

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:43.270
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:43.760
(Why?)

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:45.990
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:48.730
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:49.910
(Phew...)

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:52.520
A romantic confession!

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:54.490
A fiery confession!

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.580
A confession that stirs your soul!

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:59.290
What the heck are you 
guys going on about?

00:23:59.290 --> 00:24:02.390
What kind of confession 
would you like, Amu-chan?

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:04.500
Huh? I, uh...

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:05.660
More importantly...

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.620
Who'd you like a confession <i>from?</i>

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:10.320
Never mind!

00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:12.440
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:14.390
First Love? Love Attack!

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:17.090
Confessions are... so...

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:18.090
Doki Doki!

00:24:18.090 --> 00:24:19.250
Desu!
